      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Feeding",
        "text_sha256": "b5033670ae6a7a3783a0bdd4d9a877dbc7997d26b6d36ea11201fe95e48ca6ce",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Whether you use breast or bottle, you'll have questions. From tips & tricks to problem-solvers & picking products, here are the answers you'll want.",
        "text_sha256": "85b9a4d4caf93523fe4138267976fb2eef2d4f15fbb03751dc373694bb189677",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Health and Safety",
        "text_sha256": "72a9bb38bea5c2137167391588cc8ef6ef99bf0e2eaf7ca269fe58153b3d4348",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Keeping baby safe and healthy is your #1 priority. This is what you'll want to know before you visit the pediatrician, vaccinate and put baby to sleep.",
        "text_sha256": "c2c68b046b233cc498564b5fbcdef7b02b036c85f3348f8a03dfa76f8ee3c50b",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Postpartum Recovery and Tips",
        "text_sha256": "40c1dc247cec57cfed51d09d39ddf04bd4ae4b6902d4ee7fe46588b08b8fc0a5",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "In the midst of taking care of your new baby, you have to remember to take care of yourself too. Here's what you may go through after giving birth.",
        "text_sha256": "86b4951d3ec57cfade77a66b87d5475ba1e208e6fa375835db8c155af006b430",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Baby's Development",
        "text_sha256": "3cfb51ffabe0267554ae5dcaf6a2c3cea08191ae9709f3de77ea87a5344df238",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "That first year is packed with milestones both cute and challenging. Here's the info you need to get from cooing to crawling and everything in between.",
        "text_sha256": "22754f8ca3a902f1b08b9d9378cdc635024032477b66e3dd97f3a6bf4e850196",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Baby Basics",
        "text_sha256": "b70fdd80aa1a8fb5513898bc69ac10e29c864eb65122efb0847fb5e451497faf",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here are all the basics you need when you're bringing baby home, from changing diapers and caring for baby to soothing cries and getting your little one to sleep.",
        "text_sha256": "e4b7eb8b159d0464494b9b843cfeea79d108b2d87ba9aef989b94c5a19db0fa1",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Community Groups",
        "text_sha256": "b95beeab0ebbb123bd5a429d4016a1e7156ad8743270c89b303060cb8db7f723",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Feel like you could use a little help with this whole parenting thing? You’re not alone.",
        "text_sha256": "01b4557977a3f65bde44df1f8e999de878e54cf7fad5631fcf13d5ff78ebeb88",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
